 bash language-bash"><span class=3D"token builtin class-name">echo</span> <=
span class=3D"token string">"Get-NetComputer -Unconstrained"</span> <span c=
lass=3D"token operator">|</span> base64 </span></span>
<span class=3D"token output">R2V0LU5ldENvbXB1dGVyIC1VbmNvbnN0cmFpbmVkCg=3D=
